0.22 0.27 0.35 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 46 254.5 Td (A common pitfall in developer assignments is using Redis as an idle key-value store or using) Tj ET
0.22 0.27 0.35 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 46 241.0 Td (MongoDB with wasteful polling. In PulsePoll, both datastores perform critical, distinct) Tj ET
0.22 0.27 0.35 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 46 227.5 Td (architectural duties:) Tj ET
