0.16 0.22 0.3 rg BT /F2 8.8 Tf 52 189.0 Td (- Atomic Vote Tallies \(HINCRBY\): Executes vote increments in microseconds directly in RAM.) Tj ET
0.16 0.22 0.3 rg BT /F1 8.8 Tf 52 176.5 Td (    Avoids disk write-lock queues and eliminates race conditions under high concurrency.) Tj ET
0.16 0.22 0.3 rg BT /F2 8.8 Tf 52 162.0 Td (- Duplicate Vote Prevention \(SADD\): Checks voter uniqueness via Redis set membership at O\(1\)) Tj ET
