0.16 0.22 0.3 rg BT /F1 8.8 Tf 52 95.5 Td (    WebSocket connection and disconnection events.) Tj ET
0.18 0.28 0.45 rg BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46 74.0 Td (MongoDB 6: Durable Persistence & Audit Log) Tj ET
0.16 0.22 0.3 rg BT /F2 8.8 Tf 52 59.0 Td (- User Credential Storage: Stores user profiles with salted Bcrypt password hashes.) Tj ET
